{"seq":4,"slug":"debugging-wasm","title":"调试 WASM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/debugging-wasm","wordCount":923,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"调试-wasm\">调试 WASM</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>调试 WASM 的难点在于产物是二进制字节码，看不到源码级信息，因此需要<strong>多层手段配合</strong>。要下断点、看变量，得把 DWARF 调试信息作为自定义段嵌入 WASM，并借助 Chrome 扩展还原源码视图；只想追踪生产错误，则用轻量的 Source Maps 建立行号映射。此外，Chrome DevTools 原生支持查看 WAT、检查线性内存并做性能分析，而 <code>console_error_panic_hook</code> 把 Rust panic 转发到浏览器控制台——它是 WASM 调试几乎必备的一环。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"dwarf-调试信息\">DWARF 调试信息</h2><p>DWARF 是 WASM 采用的标准调试信息格式。Rust 编译器可以在 WASM 二进制中嵌入 DWARF 段，让调试器映射回源码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml&#10;[profile.release]&#10;debug = true&#10;strip = &quot;none&quot;&#10;&#10;[profile.dev]&#10;debug = 2&#10;opt-level = 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[profile.release]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>debug = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>strip = \"none\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[profile.dev]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>debug = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>opt-level = 0</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调试级别</th>\n<th>Cargo 配置</th>\n<th>信息量</th>\n<th>体积影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td><code>debug = 0</code></td>\n<td>无调试信息</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><code>debug = 1</code></td>\n<td>行号信息</td>\n<td>增加 20-50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><code>debug = 2</code></td>\n<td>完整调试信息</td>\n<td>增加 100-300%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>line</td>\n<td><code>debug = &quot;line-tables-only&quot;</code></td>\n<td>仅行号</td>\n<td>增加 10-20%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    RUST_SRC[&quot;Rust 源码&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;rustc + DWARF&quot;| WASM_DEBUG[&quot;.wasm (含调试段)&quot;]&#10;    WASM_DEBUG --&gt; CUSTOM_SECTIONS[&quot;自定义段&quot;]&#10;    CUSTOM_SECTIONS --&gt; DEBUG_INFO[&quot;.debug_info&quot;]&#10;    CUSTOM_SECTIONS --&gt; DEBUG_LINE[&quot;.debug_line&quot;]&#10;    CUSTOM_SECTIONS --&gt; DEBUG_ABBREV[&quot;.debug_abbrev&quot;]&#10;    CUSTOM_SECTIONS --&gt; DEBUG_STR[&quot;.debug_str&quot;]&#10;    DEBUG_LINE --&gt; DEVTOOLS[&quot;Chrome DevTools&lt;br/&gt;源码级断点&quot;]\">graph LR\n    RUST_SRC[\"Rust 源码\"] --&gt;|\"rustc + DWARF\"| WASM_DEBUG[\".wasm (含调试段)\"]\n    WASM_DEBUG --&gt; CUSTOM_SECTIONS[\"自定义段\"]\n    CUSTOM_SECTIONS --&gt; DEBUG_INFO[\".debug_info\"]\n    CUSTOM_SECTIONS --&gt; DEBUG_LINE[\".debug_line\"]\n    CUSTOM_SECTIONS --&gt; DEBUG_ABBREV[\".debug_abbrev\"]\n    CUSTOM_SECTIONS --&gt; DEBUG_STR[\".debug_str\"]\n    DEBUG_LINE --&gt; DEVTOOLS[\"Chrome DevTools&lt;br/&gt;源码级断点\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看 DWARF 段&#10;wasm-objdump -h target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/debug/my_lib.wasm&#10;&#10;# 输出示例:&#10;# Sections:&#10;#   ...&#10;#   Custom &quot;.debug_info&quot; (size=125432)&#10;#   Custom &quot;.debug_line&quot; (size=34521)&#10;#   Custom &quot;.debug_abbrev&quot; (size=8921)&#10;#   Custom &quot;.debug_str&quot; (size=45672)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 DWARF 段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-objdump</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/wasm32-unknown-unknown/debug/my_lib.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 输出示例:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Sections:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Custom \".debug_info\" (size=125432)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Custom \".debug_line\" (size=34521)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Custom \".debug_abbrev\" (size=8921)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   Custom \".debug_str\" (size=45672)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 生产构建应剥离 DWARF 信息（<code>strip = true</code>），但保留一份带调试信息的构建产物用于问题排查。可以用 <code>wasm-split</code> 将调试信息分离到独立文件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"chrome-devtools-wasm-调试\">Chrome DevTools WASM 调试</h2><p>Chrome DevTools 原生支持 WASM 调试，结合 C/C++ DevTools Support 扩展可以实现完整的 Rust 源码级调试。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Dev as 开发者&#10;    participant Chrome as Chrome DevTools&#10;    participant Ext as DWARF 扩展&#10;    participant WASM as WASM 模块&#10;&#10;    Dev-&gt;&gt;Chrome: 打开 Sources 面板&#10;    Chrome-&gt;&gt;WASM: 加载 .wasm(含 DWARF)&#10;    WASM-&gt;&gt;Ext: 解析 .debug_info&#10;    Ext-&gt;&gt;Chrome: 映射 WASM 偏移 → Rust 源码行&#10;    Dev-&gt;&gt;Chrome: 在 Rust 源码设断点&#10;    Chrome-&gt;&gt;WASM: 断点命中&#10;    Chrome-&gt;&gt;Dev: 显示 Rust 变量值\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Dev as 开发者\n    participant Chrome as Chrome DevTools\n    participant Ext as DWARF 扩展\n    participant WASM as WASM 模块\n\n    Dev-&gt;&gt;Chrome: 打开 Sources 面板\n    Chrome-&gt;&gt;WASM: 加载 .wasm(含 DWARF)\n    WASM-&gt;&gt;Ext: 解析 .debug_info\n    Ext-&gt;&gt;Chrome: 映射 WASM 偏移 → Rust 源码行\n    Dev-&gt;&gt;Chrome: 在 Rust 源码设断点\n    Chrome-&gt;&gt;WASM: 断点命中\n    Chrome-&gt;&gt;Dev: 显示 Rust 变量值</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>支持情况</th>\n<th>前提条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源码级断点</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>DWARF 调试信息 + 扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变量查看</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td><code>debug = 2</code> 完整调试信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调用栈</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>name 段或 DWARF 信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单步执行</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>DWARF 行号映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件断点</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>DevTools 原生功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存查看</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>Memory Inspector 面板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能分析</td>\n<td>✅ 支持</td>\n<td>Performance 面板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WAT 查看</td>\n<td>✅ 内置</td>\n<td>无需额外配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装 Chrome 扩展&#10;# 搜索 &quot;C/C++ DevTools Support (DWARF)&quot; 并安装&#10;&#10;# 开发服务器需要正确的 MIME 类型&#10;# Content-Type: application/wasm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装 Chrome 扩展</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 搜索 \"C/C++ DevTools Support (DWARF)\" 并安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 开发服务器需要正确的 MIME 类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Content-Type: application/wasm</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const wasmModule = await WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming(fetch(&#39;/debug/my_wasm_bg.wasm&#39;), importObject);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> wasmModule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instantiateStreaming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/debug/my_wasm_bg.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), importObject);</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> DevTools 的 WASM 调试性能与调试信息大小直接相关。对于大型模块（&gt;10MB 调试信息），建议使用 <code>debug = &quot;line-tables-only&quot;</code> 只保留行号映射，平衡调试能力和加载速度。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"source-maps\">Source Maps</h2><p>Source Maps 是 WASM 调试的另一种方式，通过映射 WASM 字节偏移到源码位置实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;sources&quot;: [&quot;src/lib.rs&quot;, &quot;src/utils.rs&quot;],&#10;  &quot;sourcesContent&quot;: [&quot;...&quot;, &quot;...&quot;],&#10;  &quot;mappings&quot;: &quot;AAAA;AACA;...&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sources\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/lib.rs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/utils.rs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sourcesContent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mappings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"AAAA;AACA;...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>DWARF</th>\n<th>Source Maps</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信息丰富度</td>\n<td>变量/类型/作用域</td>\n<td>仅行号映射</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>体积</td>\n<td>大（100-300% 增加）</td>\n<td>小（10-30% 增加）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器支持</td>\n<td>需要扩展</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加载速度</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用阶段</td>\n<td>本地开发调试</td>\n<td>生产错误追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成 Source Maps&#10;wasm-pack build --dev --target web&#10;&#10;# 在 WASM 文件中添加 sourceMappingURL&#10;# 自动嵌入到 custom section 中&#10;&#10;# 手动分离 source map&#10;wasm2wat --debug-names input.wasm -o output.wat\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成 Source Maps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm-pack</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dev</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --target</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 WASM 文件中添加 sourceMappingURL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自动嵌入到 custom section 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 手动分离 source map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasm2wat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --debug-names</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> output.wat</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    WASM[&quot;.wasm 文件&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;sourceMappingURL&quot;| SOURCEMAP[&quot;.wasm.map&quot;]&#10;    SOURCEMAP --&gt; MAPPING[&quot;偏移量 → 行号映射&quot;]&#10;    MAPPING --&gt; SRC_RS[&quot;src/lib.rs:42&quot;]&#10;    MAPPING --&gt; SRC_UTILS[&quot;src/utils.rs:17&quot;]&#10;    BROWSER[&quot;浏览器 DevTools&quot;] --&gt; SOURCEMAP&#10;    BROWSER --&gt; DISPLAY[&quot;显示 Rust 源码位置&quot;]\">graph TD\n    WASM[\".wasm 文件\"] --&gt;|\"sourceMappingURL\"| SOURCEMAP[\".wasm.map\"]\n    SOURCEMAP --&gt; MAPPING[\"偏移量 → 行号映射\"]\n    MAPPING --&gt; SRC_RS[\"src/lib.rs:42\"]\n    MAPPING --&gt; SRC_UTILS[\"src/utils.rs:17\"]\n    BROWSER[\"浏览器 DevTools\"] --&gt; SOURCEMAP\n    BROWSER --&gt; DISPLAY[\"显示 Rust 源码位置\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"console_error_panic_hook\">console_error_panic_hook</h2><p><code>console_error_panic_hook</code> 将 Rust panic 信息转发到浏览器控制台，是 WASM 调试的必备工具。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen(start)]&#10;fn init() {&#10;    console_error_panic_hook::set_once();&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn risky_operation(index: usize) -&gt; u32 {&#10;    let data = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5];&#10;    data[index]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use wasm_bindgen::prelude::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen(start)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn init() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console_error_panic_hook::set_once();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn risky_operation(index: usize) -> u32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let data = vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data[index]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 未安装 panic hook 时的错误信息:&#10;RuntimeError: unreachable executed&#10;&#10;# 安装 panic hook 后的错误信息:&#10;panicked at &#39;index out of bounds: the len is 5 but the index is 10&#39;, src/lib.rs:9:5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 未安装 panic hook 时的错误信息:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RuntimeError: unreachable executed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 安装 panic hook 后的错误信息:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>panicked at 'index out of bounds: the len is 5 but the index is 10', src/lib.rs:9:5</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# Cargo.toml&#10;[dependencies]&#10;console_error_panic_hook = &quot;0.1&quot;&#10;wasm-bindgen = &quot;0.2&quot;&#10;&#10;# 可选: 更好的日志输出&#10;console_log = &quot;1&quot;&#10;log = &quot;0.4&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Cargo.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console_error_panic_hook = \"0.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wasm-bindgen = \"0.2\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 可选: 更好的日志输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console_log = \"1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>log = \"0.4\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>console_error_panic_hook</code></td>\n<td>panic → 控制台</td>\n<td><code>set_once()</code> 一次初始化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>console_log</code></td>\n<td>log 宏 → 控制台</td>\n<td><code>console_log::init()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tracing-wasm</code></td>\n<td>tracing → 控制台</td>\n<td>Subscriber 初始化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasm-logger</code></td>\n<td>log 宏 → 控制台</td>\n<td><code>wasm_logger::init()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use log::{info, warn, error};&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen(start)]&#10;fn init() {&#10;    console_error_panic_hook::set_once();&#10;    console_log::init_with_level(log::Level::Debug).unwrap();&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[wasm_bindgen]&#10;pub fn process(data: &amp;[u8]) -&gt; Vec&lt;u8&gt; {&#10;    info!(&quot;处理 {} 字节数据&quot;, data.len());&#10;&#10;    if data.is_empty() {&#10;        warn!(&quot;收到空数据&quot;);&#10;        return vec![];&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    let result: Vec&lt;u8&gt; = data.iter().map(|b| b.wrapping_add(1)).collect();&#10;    info!(&quot;处理完成，输出 {} 字节&quot;, result.len());&#10;    result&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use log::{info, warn, error};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen(start)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn init() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console_error_panic_hook::set_once();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    console_log::init_with_level(log::Level::Debug).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[wasm_bindgen]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub fn process(data: &#x26;[u8]) -> Vec&#x3C;u8> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    info!(\"处理 {} 字节数据\", data.len());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if data.is_empty() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        warn!(\"收到空数据\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return vec![];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result: Vec&#x3C;u8> = data.iter().map(|b| b.wrapping_add(1)).collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    info!(\"处理完成，输出 {} 字节\", result.len());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>console_error_panic_hook</code> 应该在模块初始化时调用一次。使用 <code>#[wasm_bindgen(start)]</code> 标记的函数会在实例化完成后自动执行，是设置 hook 的最佳位置。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能分析\">性能分析</h2><p>Chrome DevTools 的 Performance 面板可以分析 WASM 函数的执行时间，帮助定位性能瓶颈。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function profileWasm() {&#10;  const instance = await init();&#10;&#10;  console.time(&#39;wasm-compute&#39;);&#10;  performance.mark(&#39;wasm-start&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const result = instance.exports.heavy_computation(data);&#10;&#10;  performance.mark(&#39;wasm-end&#39;);&#10;  performance.measure(&#39;WASM Computation&#39;, &#39;wasm-start&#39;, &#39;wasm-end&#39;);&#10;  console.timeEnd(&#39;wasm-compute&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const measures = performance.getEntriesByName(&#39;WASM Computation&#39;);&#10;  console.log(`耗时: ${measures[0].duration.toFixed(2)}ms`);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> profileWasm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> instance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wasm-compute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wasm-start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">heavy_computation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wasm-end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">measure</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WASM Computation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wasm-start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wasm-end'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">timeEnd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wasm-compute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> measures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> performance.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getEntriesByName</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WASM Computation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`耗时: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">measures</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">].</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">duration</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toFixed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}ms`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析方式</th>\n<th>工具/API</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>函数级别</td>\n<td>Performance 面板</td>\n<td>每个函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动计时</td>\n<td><code>performance.mark/measure</code></td>\n<td>自定义区间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存分析</td>\n<td>Memory Inspector</td>\n<td>字节级别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>火焰图</td>\n<td>Performance → Flame Chart</td>\n<td>调用栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样分析</td>\n<td><code>console.profile()</code></td>\n<td>自动采样</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PERF[&quot;性能分析流程&quot;]&#10;    PERF --&gt; RECORD[&quot;1. 录制 Performance 追踪&quot;]&#10;    RECORD --&gt; ANALYZE[&quot;2. 查看火焰图&quot;]&#10;    ANALYZE --&gt; IDENTIFY[&quot;3. 定位 WASM 热点函数&quot;]&#10;    IDENTIFY --&gt; OPTIMIZE[&quot;4. 优化策略&quot;]&#10;    OPTIMIZE --&gt; ALGO[&quot;改进算法&quot;]&#10;    OPTIMIZE --&gt; SIMD[&quot;使用 SIMD&quot;]&#10;    OPTIMIZE --&gt; BOUNDARY[&quot;减少跨边界调用&quot;]&#10;    OPTIMIZE --&gt; MEMORY[&quot;优化内存访问模式&quot;]\">graph TD\n    PERF[\"性能分析流程\"]\n    PERF --&gt; RECORD[\"1. 录制 Performance 追踪\"]\n    RECORD --&gt; ANALYZE[\"2. 查看火焰图\"]\n    ANALYZE --&gt; IDENTIFY[\"3. 定位 WASM 热点函数\"]\n    IDENTIFY --&gt; OPTIMIZE[\"4. 优化策略\"]\n    OPTIMIZE --&gt; ALGO[\"改进算法\"]\n    OPTIMIZE --&gt; SIMD[\"使用 SIMD\"]\n    OPTIMIZE --&gt; BOUNDARY[\"减少跨边界调用\"]\n    OPTIMIZE --&gt; MEMORY[\"优化内存访问模式\"]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> WASM 函数在火焰图中默认显示为 <code>wasm-function[42]</code> 这样的编号。保留 name 段（<code>wasm-bindgen</code> 默认会生成）可以让函数名显示为 <code>my_module::heavy_computation</code>，大幅提升可读性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((调试 WASM))&#10;    DWARF&#10;      标准调试格式&#10;      源码级断点&#10;      变量查看&#10;    Chrome DevTools&#10;      原生 WASM 支持&#10;      C/C++ 扩展&#10;      Memory Inspector&#10;    Source Maps&#10;      轻量行号映射&#10;      生产错误追踪&#10;      浏览器原生支持&#10;    panic hook&#10;      panic → 控制台&#10;      log 宏集成&#10;      初始化时设置&#10;    性能分析&#10;      Performance 面板&#10;      火焰图定位&#10;      mark/measure API\">mindmap\n  root((调试 WASM))\n    DWARF\n      标准调试格式\n      源码级断点\n      变量查看\n    Chrome DevTools\n      原生 WASM 支持\n      C/C++ 扩展\n      Memory Inspector\n    Source Maps\n      轻量行号映射\n      生产错误追踪\n      浏览器原生支持\n    panic hook\n      panic → 控制台\n      log 宏集成\n      初始化时设置\n    性能分析\n      Performance 面板\n      火焰图定位\n      mark/measure API</pre><ul>\n<li>DWARF 调试信息通过自定义段嵌入 WASM，配合 Chrome 扩展可实现<strong>源码级断点和变量查看</strong>。</li>\n<li>Chrome DevTools 原生支持 WASM 的 WAT 查看、内存检查和性能分析。</li>\n<li>Source Maps 提供轻量的行号映射，适合<strong>生产环境的错误追踪</strong>。</li>\n<li><code>console_error_panic_hook</code> 将 Rust panic 转发到浏览器控制台，是<strong>WASM 调试的必备工具</strong>。</li>\n<li>Performance 面板的火焰图可以定位 WASM 热点函数，配合 <code>performance.mark/measure</code> 实现精确计时。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"调试 WASM","id":"调试-wasm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"DWARF 调试信息","id":"dwarf-调试信息"},{"level":2,"text":"Chrome DevTools WASM 调试","id":"chrome-devtools-wasm-调试"},{"level":2,"text":"Source Maps","id":"source-maps"},{"level":2,"text":"console_error_panic_hook","id":"console_error_panic_hook"},{"level":2,"text":"性能分析","id":"性能分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"内存管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/rust-to-wasm/memory-management"},"next":{"title":"加载 WASM 模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly/typescript-integration/loading-wasm-modules"}}